        name: "bay hull",
        description: Some("Bay: industrial blue-gray steel. Plates 4 m by 2 m, each a tone of its own, dark seams between, and grime in patches. Unlit: a slab bay's hold is lit by the lamps the hull material draws in it. One tile is 64 m of hull and must repeat: integer frequencies, and noise with period == frequency. Output color is albedo; the layer named lights is the lit share of each texel. See em_render::hull_material."),
